      en: ["The beach has been a landing site since at least the 14th century, as evidenced by pottery fragments.", "The name 'Hantsindzi' appears in Swahili script on a 16th-century map preserved in Zanzibar.", "The beach is part of a 10-km² traditional fishing territory recognized by local law.", "Annual community festivals attract up to 500 participants in August.", "The eco-tourism project employs 12 local guides as of 2023.", "The beach is featured in the novel 'La Plage des Esprits' by Comorian author Ali Mhadji."],
